d": 103, "type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced", "title": "CLIP 1 Sampler", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SamplerCustomAdvanced"}, "order": 37}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [45], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [260, 60], "pos": [-80, 100], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 43, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 44, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 104, "type": "VAEDecode", "title": "DECODE — CLIP 1", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 38}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [38], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}], "size": [380, 220], "pos": [-1380, 100], "widgets_values": [0], "inputs": [{"name": "positive", "link": 26, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "latent", "link": 29, "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 27, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio_vae", "link": 28, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio", "link": 30, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "frame_idx"}, "name": "frame_idx", "label": "frame_idx", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "frame_idx"}], "flags": {}, "id": 105, "type": "MiniMaxH3AddGuide", "title": "ADD GUIDE — CLIP 1（10s 母带切片 · 口型同步）", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3AddGuide"}, "order": 35}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["【音频自适应：负 start_index 从末尾倒算】\n6 个 TrimAudioDuration 的 start_index 全为负值，ComfyUI 会从音频末尾倒算起点，\n间距固定 13.458333s（=323帧/24fps），单段 15.083333s（=362帧）。\n\n· 换歌后无需改任何参数，不会报 Start time 越界错误。\n· 歌曲 >= 82.4s：6 段完整覆盖末尾 82.4s，效果最佳。\n· 歌曲 < 82.4s：靠前的段被夹到 0 秒，前几段内容会重叠（不报错，但衔接变差）。\n  此时建议减少片段数，或换一首更长的歌。\n\n正序等价公式：start_index(i) = -(15.083333 + (n-1-i) * 13.458333)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [400, 260], "pos": [-1120, 560], "id": 321, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [218], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [320, 70], "pos": [-2594.02001953125, -2587.84912109375], "widgets_values": [3], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 297, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "shift"}, "name": "shift", "label": "shift", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "shift"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "ModelSamplingAuraFlow", "title": "Z-IMAGE SHIFT (3)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ModelSamplingAuraFlow"}, "order": 25}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["> ## 本文件 = 10s 单段版（由 1 分钟版改写，2026-09-11）\n> - 只保留 **CLIP 1**：length 243 帧 @24fps = **10.125s**（243 = 17×14+5，落在 H3 网格上）\n> - 音频引导切片 TrimAudioDuration = **0.0s → 10.125s**（与成片音轨同起点，口型对得上）\n> - **Z-Image 只出 1 张**：3145（九宫格角色图）同时接 ref_image_0 与 ref_image_1\n> - 已删除 CLIP 2/3/4/6、拼接链、尾帧锚定链、失效的 SeedVR2 放大链、重复的 Z-Image 第二路\n> - 想换 10s 窗口：改 SONG SLICE — CLIP 1 的 start_index（负值 = 从歌曲末尾倒算）\n\n## Z-Image 生成角色 → MiniMax H3 音乐视频（原生节点 + 无缝续写版）\n\n> 不依赖任何自定义节点包。续写机制用 ComfyUI 原生 `MiniMaxH3AddGuide` 实现，\n> 参数照抄官方 `OLD - Motion Context - Simple.json` 的实测值。\n\n### 续写原理\n每个片段生成后，取**最后 39 帧**作为 guide，锚定到下一段的第 0 帧：\n`MiniMaxH3AddGuide(positive, vae, audio_vae, latent, image=上一段尾39帧, audio=母带切片, frame_idx=0)`\n\n39 帧的依据（三重约束同时满足）：\n- 必须是 **17k+5**：5 / 22 / 39 / 56 / 73 / 90 …\n  （`MiniMaxH3AddGuide` 会把多帧 guide 裁剪到这个网格）\n- 音频 40Hz、视频 24fps，每帧 = 5/3 个音频 tick → 只有 **39 / 90 / 141 / 192（间隔 51）**\n  能让视频帧边界与音频 tick 边界同时对齐\n- 官方 `OLD - Motion Context - Simple.json` 的 `context_length` 实测就是 **39**\n\n生成后裁掉每段开头 39 帧（那是被锚定的重叠部分），再拼接 → 时间轴连续、不重复。\n\n### 音画同步\n每段用 `TrimAudioDuration` 从母带切出对应时间片，经 `AddGuide.audio` 锚定，\n使演唱口型与歌曲对齐。相邻片段起点间隔 `13.458333s`，单段 `15.083333s`。\n\n**最终输出音轨仍用整首母带**（`VHS_VideoCombine.audio`），保证音乐完整；\nAddGuide 的音频只用于引导画面生成，不进成片。\n\n### 使用步骤\n1. 改 6 个 `Z-IMAGE PROMPT`（01 front / 02 right / 03 back / 04 left /\n   05 face / 06 wide），保持**同一段人物描述**不变，只改视角部分\n2. 换 `MASTER SONG — LOAD AUDIO`（母带）\n3. 改 6 个 `CLIP n` 的分镜提示词\n4. **对齐时长**：当前 6 段 ≈ **82.375s**。\n   公式：总时长 = 单段时长 + (段数-1) × 间隔 = `15.083333 + 5 × 13.458333`\n   VHS 已开 `trim_to_audio`，视频比歌长会自动裁掉\n5. 点 Run\n\n### 参数\n| 项 | 值 |\n|---|---|\n| 分辨率 / 单段 | **1344×768**（H3 原生）/ 311 帧 @24fps |\n| 重叠（context） | 39 帧 = 1.625s |\n| 每段有效帧 | 323 帧（裁掉开头重叠） |\n| H3 采样 | 8 步 / `res_multistep` + `simple` / turbo 8 步 LoRA |\n| 景别 | 中景半身 → 近景胸以上 → 特写头肩（递进推近） |\n| 放大 | SeedVR2 3B，短边 768 → 1088（1.42×，低倍率保细节） |\n| 输出编码 | h264 / crf 14 |\n| Z-Image | Turbo：8 步 / cfg 1 / `res_multistep` + `simple` / shift 3 |\n\n### 模型文件（需自备）\n`z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors`、`qwen_3_4b.safetensors`、`ae.safetensors`、\n`minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`、\n`qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors`、\n`minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`、\n`minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`、\n`minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors`\n\n### 注意\n- **显存**：H3 主模型 + Qwen3-VL 32B + Z-Image 6B 同时驻留；\n  且 `ImageBatch` 会把各段在内存里拼成一整批再编码。\n  内存不够就减少片段数，或降到 1152×640 / 1024×576（改 5 个 R2V 节点的 width/height）\n- **加片段**：复制一组 `CLIP n`（R2V / Noise / Guider / Sampler / VAEDecode /\n  AddGuide / SongTrim / BodyTrim / TailTrim），把新段的 `AddGuide.image` 接到上一段的\n  `TAIL 39`（TailTrim 输出），再在 ImageBatch 链末尾多串一个即可\n- 拼接用的 `ImageBatch` 在 ComfyUI 里标记为 DEPRECATED（显示\n  \"Batch Images (DEPRECATED)\"），但**仍注册可用、不影响运行**，只是不在添加节点菜单里\n- 想恢复「母带精确切片 + 流式省内存拼接」，装节点包后用完整版工作流：\n  `cd <ComfyUI目录>/custom_nodes && git clone https://github.com/seitanism/ComfyUI-H3-Motion-Context-MultiRef.git`\n\n| 统一背景 | 每个 CLIP 提示词的 `environment_canvas` 段落（木构回廊 + 中庭巨松 + 云海 + 冷暖配色），6 段共用，保持一致 |"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: 使用说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [780, 950], "pos": [-3906.994873046875, -2695.91357421875], "id": 320, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [217], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [300, 40], "pos": [-1864.66650390625, -1862.666259765625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 215, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3115, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "title": "NEG (zero out) — FACE", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ConditioningZeroOut"}, "order": 28}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [219], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [300, 130], "pos": [-1864.66650390625, -1732.666259765625], "widgets_values": [1024, 1024, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3125, "type": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "title": "FACE 1024×1024", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptySD3LatentImage"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [220], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [340, 300], "pos": [-1494.66650390625, -1862.666259765625], "widgets_values": [123456789, "fixed", 8, 1, "res_multistep", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 218, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 216, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 217, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 219, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "label": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "label": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "sampler_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "name": "scheduler", "label": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "scheduler"}, {"widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "name": "denoise", "label": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "denoise"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3135, "type": "KSampler", "title": "Z-IMAGE SAMPLER — FACE", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "KSampler"}, "order": 29}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["【逐帧模型放大】\n\n链路：深度加雾输出 → UpscaleModelLoader → ImageUpscaleWithModel\n      → ImageScale(lanczos, 1920x1088) → VHS\n\n当前放大模型：RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth\n（需放在 ComfyUI 的 models/upscale_models/ 下，填**文件名**）\n\n· 放大放在加雾**之后**：LeReS 只处理 960x544，省算力。\n  想让雾更细腻可把放大链移到 comp3 之前，但 LeReS 要吃 4 倍像素。\n\n· 模型是 4x 也没关系：后面 ImageScale 会精确缩到 1920x1088。\n· 换模型：改 UpscaleModelLoader 的下拉即可，常用：\n    4x-UltraSharp.pth      锐利，适合 AI 生成内容\n    RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth  通用稳妥\n    4x_foolhardy_Remacri.pth  自然、少涂抹感\n    4x_NMKD-Siax_200k.pth  轻量快速\n\n· 注意耗时：481 帧逐帧 4x 超分很慢，建议先用 20s 版试跑。\n  显存吃紧就把目标分辨率降到 1440x816。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [430, 260], "pos": [383.6689453125, -310.1381530761719], "id": 5221, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["【面部清晰度优化（本次修订）】\n\n根因：原来 960x544 只有 H3 原生画布 (1344x768) 的一半像素，\n且三段全是\"长廊远景 + 全身\"，人脸在画面里只有几十像素 → 怎么放大都是糊的。\n\n已改 5 处：\n1) 5 个 R2V 节点 960x544 → 1344x768（H3 原生，短边 768）\n2) 景别递进：Shot1 中景半身 → Shot2 近景胸以上 → Shot3 特写头肩\n   （retention_analysis 追加了\"五官锐利、无塑料磨皮\"的保留指令）\n3) 6200 预缩放(0.5MP) 已绕过 —— 否则会把 1344x768 砍回 0.5MP，前功尽弃\n4) SeedVR2 分块：vae_tile_size 512→768、overlap 64→128（减接缝）\n5) VHS crf 19→14（人脸区域码率）\n\n关键联动：生成提到 768 短边后，SeedVR2 的放大倍率从 2.0x 降到 1.42x。\n这一步很重要 —— SeedVR2 在大倍率特写人脸上会把皮肤纹理做坏（\"塑料脸/蜥蜴皮\"），\n放大倍率越低越保留原生细节。\n\n降级路径（OOM 时按顺序试）：\n· R2V width/height → 1152x640（像素 -41%，显存压力明显下降）\n· R2V width/height → 1024x576（保底）\n· SeedVR2 batch_size 41 → 21 或 13（必须满足 4n+1）\n· 把 6200 预缩放重新启用并设 0.75 MP\n\n若特写段皮肤仍出现塑料感：\n· 把 6203 SeedVR2 设为 bypass，改用 ImageScale(lanczos) 直出 1920x1088\n· 或 SeedVR2 new_resolution 1088 → 864（再降放大倍率）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "面部清晰度优化", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [520, 560], "pos": [842.0429077148438, -535.6800537109375], "id": 6204, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "Filenames", "links": [], "label": "Filenames", "type": "VHS_FILENAMES", "localized_name": "Filenames"}], "size": [400, 1047.5555419921875], "pos": [1704.5955810546875, 205.68125915527344], "widgets_values": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": "ZImage_MV/mv_continuation", "loop_count": 0, "pix_fmt": "yuv420p", "save_metadata"